Third-party models
------------------

This repository contains no model weights. Praktika downloads or loads the
models below only when its operator configures it to. Each model is published
by its own authors under its own licence, which the operator must accept and
comply with; check the model card of the exact revision you use.

Used by default:

  * Whisper large-v3-turbo (OpenAI), English speech-to-text: MIT License.
    On macOS, the MLX conversion published as
    mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo; on a Linux server,
    openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo served by vLLM.
  * Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud), drafting, as packaged
    by Ollama under the tag qwen2.5:14b: Apache License 2.0. Not every
    Qwen2.5 model size is published under Apache 2.0.
  * Silero VAD (Silero team), voice activity detection, bundled in the
    silero-vad Python package: MIT License.

Optional, off by default:

  * Cohere Transcribe Arabic (Cohere Labs),
    CohereLabs/cohere-transcribe-arabic-07-2026: Apache License 2.0, as its
    model card states; access is gated (accept its terms on Hugging Face).
  * Whisper large-v3 (OpenAI), mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-mlx: MIT License.
  * pyannote speaker-diarization-community-1 (pyannote),
    pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International (CC BY 4.0); attribution is required; access is gated
    (accept its terms on Hugging Face).
  * Llama 3.1 8B (Meta), the code's default name for the long-transcript
    fallback model (llama3.1:8b), used only if the operator pulls it: Llama 3.1
    Community License.

Third-party software
--------------------

Python dependencies are installed from the Python Package Index under their
own licences; uv.lock lists every package and version. Ollama, vLLM, ffmpeg
and the NVIDIA container images are separate products, installed separately
under their own licences.
